    "detailed_description": "Autonomous Anarchy is a top-down twin-stick bullet hell where you take control of an autonomous tank. Fight your way through a variety of levels filled to the brim with enemy hordes, collectibles, and lots of bullets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/4b4614f6161223943b80e6a01b4bbd2a.poster.avif?t=1754632970\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/4b4614f6161223943b80e6a01b4bbd2a.webm?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/4b4614f6161223943b80e6a01b4bbd2a.mp4?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight and explore through 40 hand-crafted levels<br></li><li>5 intense multi-stage boss fights<br></li><li>6 different weapon types that can be combined to create over 20 unique weapons<br></li><li>Defeat bosses to earn upgrades like screen clearing bombs and abilities to give you an edge against the ever-increasing enemies<br></li><li>Seamless 2-player couch co-op - join in any time<br></li><li>Collect intel hidden within the rooms to spend on bombs and weapons in the shop<br></li><li>Full gamepad support</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights!</h2>There are several terrifying boss encounters to be found throughout the game. These mechanical menaces will stop at nothing to destroy you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/f40f88b20dd2d09e55ac14fb672bb9a2.poster.avif?t=1754632970\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/f40f88b20dd2d09e55ac14fb672bb9a2.webm?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/f40f88b20dd2d09e55ac14fb672bb9a2.mp4?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2-Player Co-op</h2>Grab a friend and take on the hordes together. The second player can join in at any time after the controllers have been configured.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/d4f6f0226ab75420e36d7b315a1daaab.poster.avif?t=1754632970\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/d4f6f0226ab75420e36d7b315a1daaab.webm?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/d4f6f0226ab75420e36d7b315a1daaab.mp4?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Autonomous Anarchy is a top-down twin-stick bullet hell where you take control of an autonomous tank. Fight your way through a variety of levels filled to the brim with enemy hordes, collectibles, and lots of bullets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/4b4614f6161223943b80e6a01b4bbd2a.poster.avif?t=1754632970\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/4b4614f6161223943b80e6a01b4bbd2a.webm?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/4b4614f6161223943b80e6a01b4bbd2a.mp4?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight and explore through 40 hand-crafted levels<br></li><li>5 intense multi-stage boss fights<br></li><li>6 different weapon types that can be combined to create over 20 unique weapons<br></li><li>Defeat bosses to earn upgrades like screen clearing bombs and abilities to give you an edge against the ever-increasing enemies<br></li><li>Seamless 2-player couch co-op - join in any time<br></li><li>Collect intel hidden within the rooms to spend on bombs and weapons in the shop<br></li><li>Full gamepad support</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights!</h2>There are several terrifying boss encounters to be found throughout the game. These mechanical menaces will stop at nothing to destroy you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/f40f88b20dd2d09e55ac14fb672bb9a2.poster.avif?t=1754632970\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/f40f88b20dd2d09e55ac14fb672bb9a2.webm?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/f40f88b20dd2d09e55ac14fb672bb9a2.mp4?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2-Player Co-op</h2>Grab a friend and take on the hordes together. The second player can join in at any time after the controllers have been configured.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/d4f6f0226ab75420e36d7b315a1daaab.poster.avif?t=1754632970\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/d4f6f0226ab75420e36d7b315a1daaab.webm?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626210/extras/d4f6f0226ab75420e36d7b315a1daaab.mp4?t=1754632970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
